an in <Picture 2>: short black bob, yellow raincoat, film camera.\n<Subject 2> is Kai, the young man in <Picture 3>: round glasses, long charcoal coat over a cream turtleneck.\n<Picture 1> is a blocking sketch: the RED mannequin in it stands for <Subject 1> and the BLUE mannequin stands for <Subject 2>.\nThe setting is the rooftop in <Picture 4>.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] A 5-second shot of a hand-painted anime film on the rooftop from <Picture 4>, staged like <Picture 1> — the same camera angle, framing and positions — with the real characters: no mannequins appear in the film.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] {a}\n\noverall_soundscape:\n{b}","mode":"zip"}},{"id":10,"type":"Arbor_Panel","pos":[460,1000],"size":[400,660],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"data","name":"data","shape":7,"type":"*","link":6},{"localized_name":"text","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"parse_numbers","name":"parse_numbers","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"parse_numbers"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"multiline","name":"multiline","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"multiline"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"data","name":"data","shape":6,"type":"*","links":null},{"localized_name":"tree","name":"tree","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":null}],"title":"Prompts per panel (live)","properties":{"aux_id":"1Kynx/ComfyUI-Arbor","ver":"483486536ae552e378a42ed29fe50ef44e89bc70","Node name for S&R":"Arbor_Panel"},"widgets_values":["",true,false,""],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"","parse_numbers":true,"multiline":false,"arbor_panel":""}},{"id":11,"type":"UNETLoader","pos":[900,0],"size":[400,82],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"unet_name","name":"unet_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"unet_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"weight_dtype","name":"weight_dtype","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"weight_dtype"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"MODEL","name":"MOD