":"LATENT","links":[12]}],"title":"Sheet size · 3 × 16:9 by 2 rows","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.42.0","Node name for S&R":"EmptyFlux2LatentImage"},"widgets_values":[3264,1216,1],"widgets_values_named":{"width":3264,"height":1216,"batch_size":1}},{"id":15,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[900,512],"size":[400,420],"flags":{},"order":14,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":8},{"localized_name":"text","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CONDITIONING","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[10]}],"title":"Storyboard sheet · red and blue mannequins","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.42.0","Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode"},"widgets_values":["A clean previs storyboard sheet: six panels of equal size in a grid of three columns and two rows, each panel a 16:9 frame, separated by thin straight white gutters, no text, no numbers, no captions, no arrows.\nEvery panel is a simple 3D blocking render: two plain smooth mannequin figures, like artist's posing dolls, with featureless round heads, no faces, no hair and no clothes. One mannequin is painted bright glossy RED and is small and slender; the other is painted bright glossy BLUE and is taller. Every panel shows both figures: exactly one red and one blue.\nThe set is a simple untextured light-grey 3D blockout of a flat rooftop terrace at night: a metal railing, a wooden bench, a water tank, a string of small bulbs, and blocky grey city buildings behind. Soft even light, muted grey-blue background.\nPanel 1 (top left): wide shot, the red figure stands at the railing looking out at the city; the blue figure walks in from the left holding two cans.\nPanel 2 (top middle): medium two-shot, the blue figure hands the red figure a can; she takes it with both hands.\nPanel 3 (top right): low-angle medium shot of both figures: the red figure points up at the sky, the blue figure beside her looks up where she points.\nPanel 4 (bottom left): shot from behind and slightly below: the red figure on the left and the blue figure on the right stand side by side at the railing, both looking up at the night sky.\nPanel 5 (bottom middle): medium shot, the two figures sit side by side on the wooden bench, the red figure leaning her head on the blue figure's shoulder.\nPanel 6 (bottom right): wide shot from behind, the two figures sit on the bench, small against the city."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"A clean previs storyboard sheet: six panels of equal size in a grid of three columns and two rows, each panel a 16:9 frame, separated by thin straight white gutters, no text, no numbers, no captions, no arrows.\nEvery panel is a simple 3D blocking render: two plain smooth mannequin figures, like artist's posing dolls, with featureless round heads, no faces, no hair and no clothes. One mannequin is painted bright glossy RED and is small and slender; the other is painted bright glossy BLUE and is taller. Every panel shows both figures: exactly one red and one blue.\nThe set is a simple untextured light-grey 3D blockout of a flat rooftop terrace at night: a metal railing, a wooden bench, a water tank, a string of small bulbs, and blocky grey city buildings behind. Soft even light, muted grey-blue background.\nPanel 1 (top left): wide shot, the red figure stands at the railing looking out at the city; the blue figure walks in from the left holding two cans.\nPanel 2 (top middle): medium two-shot, the blue figure hands the red figure a can; she takes it with both hands.\nPanel 3 (top right): low-angle medium shot of both figures: the red figure points up at the sky, the blue figure beside her looks up where she points.\nPanel 4 (bottom left): shot from behind and slightly below: the red figure on the left and the blue figure on the right stand side by side at the railing, both looking up at the night sky.\nPanel 5 (bottom middle): medium shot, the two figures sit side b